  "appDescription": "The Trusted FL Client as a MEC application (TD_MEC_FL_01 steps 3 and 4), registered at MEC 011 and at MN-CSE-A on behalf of the two constrained sources it names; the binding is stated in its AE's labels and in a record in its baseline container. Training runs in the driver under the same originator; the sources are simulated.",
